# Core memory: a long-term memory per project and a global one, kept out of
# context and searched on demand through the memory tool; the harness adds
# pointers to factory runs, subagent runs and sessions on its own (see the
# module's header). Rewritten when its content changes.
pi_write_core_memory_extension() {
