- Title: `<where> - <what goes wrong>`.
- Environment: version or commit, OS, how it was run.
- Steps from zero, ending with "Observe ...".
- Expected (from the basis, quoted) and Actual (facts only), apart.
- Evidence paths; how often it reproduces (always, n of m runs).
- The test that shows it, if one was written (red now, green once fixed).

