## The checks, per endpoint
- Contract: status code, content type, body shape and types against the
  spec (required fields present, no undocumented fields leaking internals),
  headers (Location after create, caching, pagination links).
- Happy path with representative data; the effect re-read with a GET (not
  only the write's response).
- Validation: each field missing, wrong type, empty, out of range,
  too long, unicode, injection strings; unknown fields; malformed JSON;
  wrong content type. Expect 400/422 with a consistent error shape that
  names the field, never a 500 or a stack trace.
