- A new dependency where the standard library or an existing one does it.

## Abstraction
- Premature: an interface, factory or config option with one user and no
  second in sight.
- Missing: copy-pasted blocks that differ in one value; a long if/else
  chain over a type that a map or polymorphism would hold.
