The method, applied to "find senior data engineer roles in Copenhagen that
fit this profile, rank them and research the best one". Each stage is
the same loop: sources, method, verification, output.

## 1. Profile (the criteria)
- Sources: the candidate's own documents only (CV, references). Nothing
