  posting body. Cache the findings per organisation with the date, and
  reuse them for 30 days.
- Verification: every claim about the employer that will be used is
  re-confirmed on a fetched page, even when it came from the cache or
  another agent. A review site that refuses the fetch leaves "culture"
  unverified, it is not filled from search snippets.
- Output: fit verdict per dimension with the evidence, the open
  questions to ask (seniority, pay band, on-call), sources with dates.

## 5. Preparing for a conversation
- Sources: what was already sent (it must stay consistent), the cached
  research, public professional profiles of named people only.
- Method: 2 to 3 recent, verifiable specifics to mention; no speculation
  about people beyond public information.
- Output: likely questions mapped to evidence, and gaps answered
  honestly.

