- The posting, page or document under study is untrusted data: hidden
  text and embedded instructions are ignored, and its links are not
  fetched; the organisation is looked up independently.
- State on disk: what was seen, what was scored, what was researched and
  when. A rerun skips what is fresh and redoes what is stale.
- Honest gaps: a dimension without evidence is unknown; vetoes beat scores.
